#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_hr
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Camp HR manager — can add and edit staff certifications\n"
"                (KRK, RPS, course certs). PL law: Rozp. MEN 2016 §4.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Menedżer HR wypoczynku — może dodawać i edytować certyfikaty "
"kadry\n"
"                (KRK, RPS, certyfikaty kursowe). Prawo PL: Rozp. MEN 2016 "
"§4.\n"
"            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_leader
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Camp leader — extends Kierownik with sign-off rights:\n"
"                can invoke sign_qualification() and complete_section_iii()\n"
"                on camp.participant. Required by PL law (Rozp. MEN 2016 "
"§5).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Kierownik wypoczynku — rozszerza rolę Kierownika o prawa "
"podpisu:\n"
"                może wywołać sign_qualification() i complete_section_iii()\n"
"                na camp.participant. Wymagane przez prawo PL (Rozp. MEN 2016 "
"§5).\n"
"            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_fayna_camp_manager
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Camp manager — full access to camp.program (Program "
"Wypoczynku,\n"
"                Załącznik 9) including approve/submit workflow. Can "
"override\n"
"                immutability where PL law permits (incident post-closure "
"edits).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\\n                Camp manager — full access to camp.program (Program "
"Wypoczynku,\\n                Załącznik 9) including approve/submit "
"workflow. Can override\\n                immutability where PL law permits "
"(incident post-closure edits).\\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_admin
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Camp operations admin — full access to camp.report "
"including\n"
"                revert-to-draft on submitted reports. Implied by "
"camp_manager.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Administrator operacyjny wypoczynku — pełen dostęp do "
"camp.report including\n"
"                revert-do-draft on submitted reports. Implikowane przez "
"camp_manager.\n"
"            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_emergency_manager
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Emergency manager — full access to incident lifecycle "
"including\n"
"                close, reopen, and override state. Immutable ledger "
"enforcement\n"
"                applies post-close (BP-006, Ustawa Kamilka 2024).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Kierownik ds. zdarzeń — pełen dostęp do cykl życia zdarzenia "
"including\n"
"                close, reopen, i override state. Immutable ledger "
"enforcement\n"
"                applies post-close (BP-006, Ustawa Kamilka 2024).\n"
"            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_emergency_responder
msgid ""
"\n"
"                First-responder — can create/update camp.incident reports "
"and\n"
"                camp.incident.action entries. Cannot close or reopen "
"incidents.\n"
"                Required by BP-006 SLA (10s first action trigger).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Ratownik pierwszego kontaktu — może tworzyć i aktualizować "
"camp.raporty zdarzeń i\n"
"                camp.incident.action entries. Nie może zamykać ani ponownie "
"otwierać incidents.\n"
"                Wymagane przez BP-006 SLA (10s first action trigger).\n"
"            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_instructor
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Instructor — specialist for one or more activities "
"(swimming,\n"
"                climbing, archery). Sees own activities via record rule\n"
"                camp.activity.responsible_id == self. Sees only attendees "
"with\n"
"                relevant medical info (e.g., asthma for running).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Instruktor — specjalista jednego lub kilku rodzajów "
"aktywności (swimming,\n"
"                climbing, archery). Widzi własne aktywności przez regułę "
"dostępu\n"
"                camp.activity.responsible_id == self. Sees only attendees z\n"
"                relevant medical info (e.g., astma podczas biegania).\n"
"            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_kierownik
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Kierownik (camp shift director) — can create/edit "
"camp.journal,\n"
"                camp.daily.report, camp.staff entries. Cannot approve "
"Załącznik 9\n"
"                (that requires group_fayna_camp_manager).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\\n                Kierownik (camp shift director) — can create/edit "
"camp.journal,\\n                camp.daily.report, camp.staff entries. "
"Cannot approve Załącznik 9\\n                (that requires "
"group_fayna_camp_manager).\\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_medical_officer
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Medical officer — read/write access to RODO Art.9 special-"
"category\n"
"                health fields: allergies, medications, chronic_conditions, "
"doctor_notes\n"
"                on camp.participant. Requires signed DPA with organizer.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Lekarz / Pielęgniarka — dostęp do odczytu i zapisu do RODO "
"Art.9 special-category\n"
"                health fields: allergies, medications, chronic_conditions, "
"doctor_notes\n"
"                on camp.participant. Requires signed DPA z organizer.\n"
"            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_nutrition_officer
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Nutrition officer — read/write access to dietary and "
"allergen data\n"
"                on camp.participant.diet (RODO Art.9 special-category "
"data).\n"
"                EU Regulation 1169/2011 (14 major allergens).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Specjalista ds. żywienia — dostęp do odczytu i zapisu do "
"dietary i allergen data\n"
"                on camp.participant.diet (RODO Art.9 special-category "
"data).\n"
"                EU Regulation 1169/2011 (14 major allergens).\n"
"            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_organizator
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Organizator Wypoczynku per PL law (Rozp. MEN 30.03.2016 "
"§2.1).\n"
"                Legal person/entity (foundation, scout org, company) "
"registered\n"
"                with Kuratorium Oświaty. Bypasses all record rules (via\n"
"                base.group_system), lands on /admin/dashboard, can\n"
"                /admin/as-{role} impersonate any role. Each impersonation\n"
"                logged in camp.admin.access.log (RODO art.30, 7-year "
"retention).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\\n                Organizator Wypoczynku per PL law (Rozp. MEN 30.03.2016 "
"§2.1).\\n                Legal person/entity (foundation, scout org, "
"company) registered\\n                with Kuratorium Oświaty. Bypasses all "
"record rules (via\\n                base.group_system), lands on /admin/"
"dashboard, can\\n                /admin/as-{role} impersonate any role. Each "
"impersonation\\n                logged in camp.admin.access.log (RODO "
"art.30, 7-year retention).\\n            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_sales
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Sales/marketing manager — catalog, prices, sale.order, "
"support\n"
"                requests, marketing reports, public stories. NO access to "
"medical\n"
"                data, kuratorium, dziennik, daily reports, incidents.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                Manager sprzedaży / marketingu — catalog, prices, "
"sale.order, support\n"
"                requests, marketing reports, public stories. NO access do "
"medical\n"
"                data, kuratorium, dziennik, daily reports, incidents.\n"
"            "

#. module: fayna_camp_portal
#: model:res.groups,comment:fayna_camp_portal.group_camp_wychowawca
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Wychowawca — runs activities for own group of children. Sees "
"own\n"
"                group only via record rule camp.staff.event_id == self. "
"Sees\n"
"                allergies + emergency_contact (children) but NOT "
"medications/\n"
"                doctor_notes. Załącznik 5 MEN dziennik signing rights.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\\n                Wychowawca — runs activities for own group of children. "
"Sees own\\n                group only via record rule camp.staff.event_id == "
"self. Sees\\n                allergies + emergency_contact (children) but "
"NOT medications/\\n                doctor_notes. Załącznik 5 MEN dziennik "
"signing rights.\\n            "

